- Custom tunes, ABC notation, dedicated keyboard layout
- Custom vibration patterns
- Edit alarms on the phone config page, as well as tunes & vibrations
- Auto-dismiss option to have silent alarms that hide the alarm screen
- Current time on the alarm screen
- Vertical button labels on the alarm screen
- Backlight stays on while the alarm screen is showing
- "+ New alarm" moved to the top
- Reorganized, collapsible config page
- New built-in vibrations include some PebbleOS patterns
- Long-press a tune or vibration to set it as default
- Text cursor navigation on the watch keyboard
- Alarms still ring when the system delays their wakeup
- More robust alarm schedule storage across app updates
- Other minor improvements
